# Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in your own values. Never commit real tokens.
# Each teammate needs their own .env.local. Restart `npm run dev` after editing it.
#
# VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN (optional)
#   Cesium ion access token used to stream Photorealistic 3D Tiles (ion asset 2275207, Google's
#   photoreal tiles distributed through ion). When missing or invalid the app falls back to an
#   OpenStreetMap raster globe and shows a banner; everything else still works.
#   The tiles are used for DISPLAY ONLY. They are never a data source for the simulation.
#
#   How to get one:
#     1. https://ion.cesium.com -> sign in (free tier is enough for a demo).
#     2. Asset Depot -> "Google Photorealistic 3D Tiles" -> Add to my assets.
#     3. Access Tokens -> Create token:
#          Scopes: assets:read only (nothing else is needed).
#          Allowed URLs: http://localhost:* and your deploy domain.
#     4. Account -> Usage: watch the 3D Tiles streaming quota; free tier has a monthly cap.
#   See README.md "3D tiles setup (Cesium ion)".
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=
